  <div class="callout intu"><span class="label">Key insight</span><p>One sentence holds the note: <strong>a chart is a computation (counts, quartiles, means, fits) drawn as positions and lengths so the eye can see what summaries hide, and it is only as good as the question it was chosen for and the honesty of its scales.</strong></p></div>
